### MCDT Two-Step Confirmation Safe Client Shutdown
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:25580
@token = test-token

### 1. Step 1: Request client shutdown (returns single-use confirmToken)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/session/quit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 2. Step 2: Confirm shutdown (pass the confirmToken from Step 1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/session/quit/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "confirmToken": "PASTE_CONFIRM_TOKEN_HERE"
}

### 3. Read current session state
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/session
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 4. Pause session
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/session/pause
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paused": true
}

### 5. Disconnect from world or server
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/session/disconnect
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 6. Open singleplayer to LAN
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/session/lan
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "port": 25565,
  "gameMode": "survival",
  "allowCommands": false
}

### 7. List saved singleplayer worlds
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/worlds
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 8. Load singleplayer world
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/worlds/New%20World/load
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 9. Delete world: Step 1 (request confirm token)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/v1/worlds/WorldToDelete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 10. Delete world: Step 2 (confirm deletion)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/worlds/WorldToDelete/delete/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "confirmToken": "PASTE_TOKEN_HERE"
}

### 11. List saved multiplayer servers
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/servers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 12. Add multiplayer server
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/servers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Hypixel",
  "address": "mc.hypixel.net"
}

### 13. Connect to multiplayer server
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/servers/connect
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": "127.0.0.1:25565"
}

### 14. Delete server: Step 1 (request confirm token)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/v1/servers/0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580

### 15. Delete server: Step 2 (confirm removal)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/servers/0/delete/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Host: 127.0.0.1:25580
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "confirmToken": "PASTE_TOKEN_HERE"
}
